along the way.\" : \"The best part? Now you know a few things you didn’t before.\"}</p>{attempt.id !== null && <span className=\"mt-4 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[10px] font-medium text-[#789064]\"><Icon name=\"check\" size={13} />Saved to your attempts</span>}</div></section>\n\n  Line 10:     {!user && <div className=\"mb-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-[#e4e7dc] bg-white p-5\"><div className=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span className=\"rounded-xl bg-[#f1f4e9] p-3\"><Icon name=\"history\" size={21} /></span><div><h3 className=\"text-sm font-medium\">Sign in to save your results</h3><p className=\"mt-1 text-[11px] text-muted\">Keep this discovery. See how you grow.</p></div></div><button onClick={onSignIn} className={`${primaryButton} py-2.5 text-xs`}>Sign in<Icon name=\"arrow\" size={15} /></button></div>}\n\n  Line 12:     <div className=\"space-y-4\">{attempt.answers.map((answer, index) => <article key={answer.question_id} className=\"rounded-2xl border border-[#e2e7dc] bg-white p-5 sm:p-7\"><div className=\"mb-5 flex items-start gap-3\"><span className=\"mt-0.5 flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-paper text-[10px] text-muted\">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, \"0\")}</span><h3 className=\"flex-1 text-[15px] leading-relaxed font-medium\">{answer.text}</h3><span className={`mt-0.5 flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-[9px] font-medium ${answer.is_correct ? \"bg-[#edf4e5] text-[#6b8758]\" : \"bg-[#faf0e9] text-[#b48266]\"}`}><Icon name={answer.is_correct ? \"check\" : \"close\"} size={12} /><span className=\"hidden sm:block\">{answer.is_correct ? \"Correct\" : \"A new discovery\"}</span></span></div><div className=\"grid gap-2.5 sm:grid-cols-2\">{OPTIONS.map(option => <div key={option} className={`flex items-center gap-3 rounded-lg border px-3.5 py-3 text-xs ${option === answer.correct_option ? \"border-[#c4d8b2] bg-[#f0f6e9] text-[#567044]\" : option === answer.selected ? \"border-[#e8d5c8] bg-[#fbf2ed] text-[#9f7057]\" : \"border-[#edf0e7] text-[#91988b]\"}`}><span className=\"text-[10px] font-semibold\">{option}</span><span className=\"flex-1\">{optionText(answer, option)}</span>{option === answer.correct_option ? <span className=\"flex items-center gap-1 text-[9px]\"><Icon name=\"check\" size={12} />{option === answer.selected ? \"Your answer\" : \"Correct\"}</span> : option === answer.selected && <span className=\"flex items-center gap-1 text-[9px]\"><Icon name=\"close\" size={12} />Your answer</span>}</div>)}</div></article>)}</div>\n\n\n/workspace/frontend/src/Admin.tsx:\n  Line 43:     {success && <p role=\"status\" className=\"mb-5 flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-[#d7e5cb] bg-[#edf4e6] p-4 text-xs text-[#6d845b]\"><Icon name=\"check\" size={16} />A new discovery is ready. Your question has been added.</p>}\n\n  Line 45:     {!data && !error ? <Loading label=\"Opening the question collection…\" /> : data && <><div className=\"mb-5 flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#e0e5d8] py-4\"><h2 className=\"text-sm font-medium\">Question collection <span className=\"ml-2 rounded-full bg-[#e9efdf] px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] text-[#7d8d6c]\">{data.total}</span></h2><p className=\"text-[10px] text-muted\">Only visible to the admin</p></div><div className=\"space-y-4\">{data.items.map(question => <article key={question.id} className=\"rounded-2xl border border-[#e0e6d9] bg-white p-5 sm:p-6\"><div className=\"mb-4 flex items-start gap-3\"><span className=\"mt-0.5 text-[10px] text-[#9aa68e]\">#{question.id}</span><h3 className=\"text-sm leading-relaxed font-medium\">{question.text}</h3></div><div className=\"grid gap-2 sm:grid-cols-2\">{OPTIONS.map(option => <div key={option} className={`flex items-center gap-3 rounded-lg px-3 py-2.5 text-xs ${option === question.correct_option ? \"bg-[#edf4e5] text-[#607d4f]\" : \"bg-[#f7f8f4] text-[#8d9684]\"}`}><span className=\"text-[10px] font-medium\">{option}</s