]\">\n\n  Line 15:         <div className=\"mb-5 flex items-center gap-2 text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-[.18em] text-[#63755b]\"><Icon name=\"spark\" size={14} />YOUR DAILY BRAIN BOOST</div>\n\n  Line 17:         <p className=\"mt-4 max-w-[320px] text-[13px] leading-[1.8] text-[#73806b]\">Big ideas, little-known facts, and a few “I knew that!” moments. Give your brain a little adventure.</p>\n\n  Line 18:         <div className=\"mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-2 text-[10px] font-medium text-[#617057]\"><span className=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\"><Icon name=\"check\" size={13} />Always something new</span><span className=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\"><Icon name=\"check\" size={13} />Just a few minutes</span></div>\n\n  Line 23:       <section className=\"rounded-[20px] border border-[#e4e7df] bg-white p-6 sm:p-7\">\n\n  Line 24:         <div className=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3\"><div className=\"flex items-center gap-3.5\"><span className=\"flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#f0f3e9] text-[#778960]\"><Icon name=\"globe\" size={23} /></span><div><h2 className=\"text-[19px] font-semibold tracking-[-.5px]\">The everyday quiz</h2><p className=\"mt-1 text-[11px] text-muted\">A little bit of everything. A fresh mix, every time.</p></div></div><span className=\"hidden rounded-full bg-[#f3f5ed] px-3 py-1.5 text-[9px] font-medium text-[#7f8a6d] sm:block\">GENERAL KNOWLEDGE</span></div>\n\n  Line 25:         <fieldset className=\"mt-7\"><legend className=\"mb-3 text-[11px] font-medium text-[#70786d]\">How curious are you feeling?</legend><div className=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-2.5\">{([{ count: 5, label: \"Quick spark\" }, { count: 10, label: \"A good stretch\" }, { count: 15, label: \"Deep dive\" }]).map(item => <label key={item.count} className={`relative flex cursor-pointer flex-col items-center rounded-xl border px-2 py-3.5 transition-colors ${count === item.count ? \"border-[#82986f] bg-[#f1f5e9]\" : \"border-[#e6e8e1] hover:bg-paper\"}`}><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz-length\" value={item.count} checked={count === item.count} onChange={() => setCount(item.count)} className=\"peer sr-only\" /><span className=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 rounded-xl peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-[#73966b]\" /><span className=\"text-[19px] leading-none font-semibold\">{item.count}<span className=\"ml-1 text-[10px] font-normal text-muted\">questions</span></span><span className=\"mt-2 text-[10px] text-muted\">{item.label}</span>{count === item.count && <span className=\"absolute top-2 right-2 flex h-3 w-3 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#84996f] text-white\"><Icon name=\"check\" size={9} /></span>}</label>)}</div></fieldset>\n\n  Line 28:         <div className=\"mt-3.5 flex items-center justify-center gap-4 text-[10px] text-[#969c90]\"><span className=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\"><Icon name=\"clock\" size={12} />About {Math.round(count * .4)} minutes</span><span className=\"h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-[#c5cbbf]\" /><span>No pressure. Just curiosity.</span></div>\n\n  Line 30:       <aside className=\"relative flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[20px] border border-[#e5e5d4] bg-[#f0f0e4] p-6 sm:p-7\">\n\n  Line 31:         <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span className=\"text-[9px] font-semibold tracking-[.16em] text-[#86876a]\">THE CURIOSITY CORNER</span><Icon name=\"bulb\" size={25} className=\"text-[#898e6d]\" /></div>\n\n  Line 32:         <p className=\"mt-7 text-[11px] font-medium text-[#929379]\">Did you know?</p>\n\n  Line 33:         <h2 className=\"mt-2 font-serif text-[33px] leading-[1.17] tracking-[-.7px] text-[#505b43]\">An octopus has<br />three hearts.</h2>\n\n  Line 34:         <p className=\"mt-4 max-w-[260px] text-[11px] leading-[1.9] text-[#8a8e79]\">Two pump blood to the gills. The third keeps it flowing to the rest of the body. Talk about putting your heart into it.</p>\n\n  Line 35:         <div className=\"mt-auto pt-5\"><p className=\"flex items-center gap-2 border-t border-[#dedfce] pt-4 text-[10px] text-[#8b8e76]\"><Icon name=\"spark\" size={13} />A tiny fact. A bigger world.</p></div>\n\n  Line 38:     <section className=\"mt-9\"><div className=\"mb-5 flex items-center gap-3\"><h2 className=\"text-[17px] font-semibold tracking-[-.4px]\">Small quiz. Big possibilities.</h2><span className=\"h-px flex-1 bg-[#e3e6dc]\" /></div><div className=\"grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-3\">{[\n\n  Line 42:     ].map(item => <div key={item.number} className=\"rounded-2xl border border-[#e5e8df] bg-[#fbfcf8] p-5\"><div className=\"mb-4 flex items-center justify-between\"><Icon name={item.icon} size={20} className=\"text-[#8e9a7b]\" /><span className=\"text-[10px] text-[#b0b8a7]\">{item.number}</span></div><h3 className=\"text-xs font-semibold\">{item.title}</h3><p className=\"mt-2 text-[11px] leading-[1.9] text-[#92988b]\">{item.text}</p></div>)}</div></section>\n\n  Line 43:     {!user && <p className=\"mt-7 text-center text-[11px] text-muted\">Your curiosity deserves a little history. <button onClick={onSignIn} className=\"ml-1 font-medium text-[#637955] underline decoration-[#c0cbb5] underline-offset-4 hover:text-ink\">Create a free account <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></button></p>}\n\n\n/workspace/frontend/src/App.tsx:\n  Line 80:     <aside className={`fixed inset-y-0 left-0 z-40 flex w-[224px] flex-col border-r border-[#e4e8df] bg-[#fcfdf9] px-5 py-8 transition-transform duration-200 md:translate-x-0 xl:w-[238px] ${mobileNav ? \"translate-x-0\" : \"-translate-x-full\"}`}>\n\n  Line 81:       <button onClick={() => navigate(\"home\")} className=\"mb-12 ml-3 flex w-fit items-center gap-2.5\" aria-label=\"Quizly home\"><span className=\"flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-[11px] bg-lime\"><Icon name=\"spark\" size={25} /></span><span className=\"text-[29px] font-semibold tracking-[-1.8px]\">quizly<span className=\"text-[#92ab72]\">.</span></span></button>\n\n  Line 82:       <p className=\"mb-4 pl-4 text-[9px] font-medium tracking-[.17em] text-[#a1a999]\">A LITTLE EXPLORATION</p>\n\n  Line 83:       <nav aria-label=\"Main navigation\" className=\"space-y-2\">{nav.map(item => { const active = item.screen === \"home\" ? [\"home\", \"quiz\", \"result\"].includes(screen) : screen === item.screen; return <button key={item.screen} onClick={() => navigate(item.screen)} aria-current={active ? \"page\" : undefined} className={`flex w-full items-center gap-3 rounded-xl px-4 py-3.5 text-[12px] ${active ? \"bg-[#eaf0df] font-medium text-[#536847]\" : \"text-[#8e9687] hover:bg-[#f1f4ea] hover:text-ink\"}`}><Icon name={item.icon} size={18} />{item.title}{active && <span className=\"ml-auto h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7d9767]\" />}</button>; })}</nav>\n\n  Line 84:       <div className=\"mt-auto pt-12\"><div className=\"relative mb-7 rounded-2xl border border-[#e3e7d9] bg-[#f4f6ee] px-4 py-5\"><span className=\"mb-3 flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-[#dfe6d1] bg-[#fcfdf7] text-[#8a9b72]\"><Icon name=\"leaf\" size={17} /></span><p className=\"text-[12px] font-medium tracking-[-.2px]\">Keep that spark alive.</p><p className=\"mt-2 text-[10px] leading-[1.85] text-[#949c89]\">You don’t have to know it all.<br />Just be curious enough to ask.</p><button onClick={() => setHelp(true)} className=\"mt-4 flex items-center gap-2 text-[10px] font-medium text-[#7e906b] hover:text-ink\">How it works<Icon name=\"arrow\" size={13} /></button></div>\n\n  Line 85:         <div className=\"border-t border-[#e6e9df] pt-5\">{user ? <div className=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\"><span className=\"flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#e8eddf] text-xs font-medium uppercase\">{user.username.slice(0, 2)}</span><div className=\"min-w-0 flex-1\"><p className=\"truncate text-xs font-medium\">{user.username}</p><p className=\"mt-1 text-[9px] text-muted\">{user.is_admin ? \"The question keeper\" : \"A curious mind\"}</p></div><button onClick={() => void signOut()} aria-label=\"Sign out\" title=\"Sign out\" className=\"rounded-lg p-2 text-muted hover:bg-mint hover:text-ink\"><Icon name=\"logout\" size={16} /></button></div> : <button onClick={() => { setAuth(\"login\"); setMobileNav(false); }} disabled={checking} className=\"flex w-full items-center gap-2.5 rounded-xl text-left\"><span className=\"flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-[#e3e8da] bg-[#f4f6ef] text-[#9aa58c]\"><Icon name=\"user\" size={16} /></span><span className=\"flex-1\"><span className=\"block text-xs font-medium\">{checking ? \"One moment…\" : \"A curious visitor\"}</span><span className=\"mt-1 block text-[9px] text-[#98a18e]\">Sign in to make it yours</span></span><Icon name=\"chevron\" size={13} className=\"text-muted\" /></button>}</div>\n\n  Line 89:       <header className=\"flex h-[77px] items-center justify-between border-b border-[#e4e8df] px-5 sm:px-9 lg:px-11\"><div className=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><button aria-label=\"Open navigation\" onClick={() => setMobileNav(true)} className=\"rounded-lg p-1 md:hidden\"><Icon name=\"menu\" size={22} /></button><span className=\"hidden text-[11px] text-[#a1a999] sm:block\">Your little corner of curiosity</span><span className=\"hidden px-1 text-[10px] text-[#c4cabb] sm:block\">/</span><span className=\"text-[11px] font-medium text-[#6d7b60]\">{pageName}</span></div><div className=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><button aria-label=\"How Quizly works\" onClick={() => setHelp(true)} className=\"rounded-full p-1 text-[#9da58f] hover:text-ink\"><Icon name=\"help\" size={18} /></button><span className=\"h-4 w-px bg-[#e0e5d7]\" />{user ? <span className=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] text-[#78866a]\"><span className=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#8da477]\" /><span className=\"max-w-28 truncate\">{user.username}</span></span> : <button disabled={checking} onClick={() => setAuth(\"login\")} className=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] font-medium text-[#6d7b60] hover:text-ink\">Sign in<Icon name=\"arrow\" size={14} /></button>}</div></header>\n\n  Line 91:         {notice && <div role=\"status\" className=\"mb-5 flex items-start justify-between gap-4 rounded-xl border border-[#dedfc9] bg-[#f2f1e5] p-4 text-xs leading-relaxed text-[#80826a]\">{notice}<button onClick={() => setNotice(\"\")} aria-label=\"Dismiss notification\"><Icon name=\"close\" size={15} /></button></div>}\n\n  Line 97:         {screen === \"admin\" && (user?.is_admin ? <Admin /> : <div className=\"rounded-2xl border border-[#e2e7dc] bg-white p-10 text-center\"><Icon name=\"shield\" size={30} className=\"mx-auto mb-4 text-muted\" /><h1 className=\"text-xl font-medium\">This little corner is for the admin.</h1><button onClick={() => setAuth(\"login\")} className={`${primaryButton} mt-5`}>Sign in</button></div>)}\n\n  Line 98:         <footer className=\"mt-9 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 border-t border-[#e3e7da] pt-5 text-[9px] text-[#a3aa99]\"><p>Made for curious minds, everywhere.</p><span className=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\">A little wiser. A little brighter.<Icon name=\"spark\" size={12} /></span></footer>\n","metadata":{"matches":74,"truncated":false},"title":"//|/\\*|#","time":{"start":1794303647199,"end":1794303647373}},"id":"prt_1c4d4ddd7001nH5m1dgdWMuvJW","sessionID":"ses_e3b3ca287ffeW1XfQqh9dYPxo0","messageID":"msg_1c4d4beb400149YWa5zW7TUNoB"}}
